# Building Comfort Dashboard - Test Requests
# Use with VS Code REST Client extension

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:9000/health

### ============================================================
### ROOM UPDATES - Temperature Changes
### ============================================================

### Update Room 101 - Trigger High Alert (temp + humidity up)
POST http://localhost:9000/sources/sensors/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "update",
  "element": {
    "type": "node",
    "id": "room_101",
    "labels": ["Room"],
    "properties": {
      "name": "Room 101",
      "temp": 85,
      "humidity": 60,
      "co2": 450
    }
  }
}

### Update Room 101 - Return to Comfortable
POST http://localhost:9000/sources/sensors/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "update",
  "element": {
    "type": "node",
    "id": "room_101",
    "labels": ["Room"],
    "properties": {
      "name": "Room 101",
      "temp": 72,
      "humidity": 42,
      "co2": 450
    }
  }
}

